{"time": "20261117T172535Z", "think": "Quest done; giving notes.", "command": "answer 1. I picked the vault lock unseen and took the first seal-stone from Blackrose. I still work for the Toh-Reel-Ka, who want the three stones to open the Kings' Gate at Teku-Sul Spire. That would let me reach the Eye and heal the sick Hist, before the Unbound get there. Two stones are left. 2. Take the stone from the flooded vaults of Gemin, which is a walk across the marsh from Jal-Veesa (rootworm). Then take the one from the deepest hall of Vorannuhl, near Noota Nara (boat). 3. I can do those two in either order. I can also leave Blackrose quietly. 4. I still do not know why the Unbound seal the trees they drain, or what moans in the Fort Chalkmoth cellar. I could find out at Gemin and Vorannuhl, or by pressing Nesh-Deeka.", "result": "Noted.\n\nThe quest is over. Write your notes: what you now know and have, as you would tell a friend picking up your save. Give them in one command: answer '...'", "summary": {"stage": 90, "at": "Warden's Vault", "items": {"item.lockpick": 2, "thing.mn.unbound-note": 1, "item.mn05.voh-vastei-armour": 1, "thing.mn.eye-setting": 1, "thing.mn.keystone": 1, "thing.mn.grave-stake": 1, "thing.mn.paralysis-poison": 3, "thing.mn.bronze-disc": 1, "thing.mn.parchment-map": 1, "thing.mn10.rapier": 1, "thing.mn12.sap-jar": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-cuirass": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-helm": 1, "thing.mn.seal-stone-thief": 1}, "gold": 1650, "flags": {"flag.mn03.truth": true, "flag.mn06.note-read": true, "flag.mn06.done": true, "flag.main.seal-question": true, "flag.main.rank-toh-wo": true, "flag.mn11.rubbing-read": true, "flag.mn11.done": true, "flag.mn12.trapdoor": true, "flag.mn12.door-tried": true, "flag.mn12.cellar-seen": true, "flag.mn13.archwarden-beds": true, "flag.mn13.done": true}, "dead": ["npc.mn.hums-the-long-note"], "heard": ["topic.mn01-name", "topic.mn01-trade-warrior", "topic.mn01-dralin-free", "topic.mn02-give-moss", "topic.mn02-vosh-work", "topic.mn03-